c books these four  comic book series include the iconic  house of m series the scarlet witch run  by james robinson  the vision and the scarlet witch and the  vision run by tom king  now the fact that these four comic books  are going to make up  what we see in the one division series  that actually means that we know a lot  about what to expect  and knowing all of these stories about  the scarlet witch and vision and knowing  that they're all about to be combined  into a tv  show makes this show one of the most  exciting marvel projects ever done  and if you don't know the stories don't  worry i'm about to go over them all  we'll first start off with the scarlet  witch run by james robinson  now this run is very very new it's about  four to five years  old but this comic was very different  because typically the scarlet witch  comics focused on her  and somebody else like her brother or  vision but this particular comic was  all about her and it focused on the  witchcraft  world this comic run was all about her  going around the world to investigate  the mystery of what's gone wrong with  the witchcraft in the marvel universe  and while she does this she also  discovers where she came from and her  larger place in the occult  corner of the marvel universe and we've  already seen this with some leaked  photos we've seen leaked photos of  agatha harkness and  the salem witches so we already know  where the influence from this run is  going to be in the one division series  they're going to explore more of the  occult more of the actual witchcraft  side and marvel studios has already said  that for the very first time in the mcu  we're actually going to hear wanda be  called the scarlet witch so it seems  very clear that at some point in time  in this series one is going to focus  more on her actual  witchcraft abilities which will be  interesting to see considering the fact  that she got her powers from  the mind stone the next comic we have is  the vision  and i'm 