oing to be so exciting  things start to get pretty intense in  the vision in the scarlet witch run  and in the house of mrun so in volume 1  of the vision and the scarlet witch  magneto is actually the father of the  scarlet witch and her brother  quicksilver now in 2014 marvel would go  on to change this and say that magneto  wasn't actually their father  but for about 30 years in the marvel  universe magneto was the father of the  scarlet witch and quicksilver  and in the first volume of the vision  and the scarlet witch magneto plans to  give up his villainous life  then in the second volume the scarlet  witch actually gets pregnant but she  doesn't get pregnant from vision because  he's an android but it's actually magic  that gets her pregnant and she ends up  having two twin boys  wiccan and speed who of course are  already confirmed to come  in the one division series but  unfortunately her story with her twin  boys in the comics takes a darker turn  leading up to the house of m event we  discover that her boys aren't  actually real it's simply wanda using  her reality warping abilities to make it  seem like she has kids but whenever her  and vision leave to fight with the  avengers the boys disappear  however they weren't entirely unreal and  wanda is able to bring them to true life  using her powers and soul fragments of  the demon mephisto  now unfortunately when mephista would  return he would want his soul fragments  back taking away the children of wanda  and vision and this is where it gets  really rough for wanda  wanda has a mental breakdown and she  tries to warp reality to recreate her  lost children  and what happens is the scarlet witch  and professor xavier end up creating the  house of  m reality in this reality wanda has her  boys back and she's able to be with her  father  magneto and her brother quicksilver this  reality grants everybody their deepest  wishes magneto rules this reality ruler  over mutants  and humans spider-man is a celebrity  married to gwen stacy  and wolverine is an agent of shield and  this reality becomes the main reality  for a little bit  and none of the heroes the avengers or  the x-men can seem to remember the  previous reality except  for wolverine so he goes and he tells  the avengers  meanwhile professor xavier meets with  them as well and they decide together  that they have to kill wanda  quicksilver finds out about this and he  runs and he tells magneto here  the x-men and the avengers attack the  house of m the scarlet witch  quicksilver and their father magneto it  is soon revealed to magneto that this  world is a lie and it's not real it was  created by his daughter the scarlet  witch and he freaks out in anger  he ends up killing his son quick silver  but suddenly wanda appears and brings  quicksilver back to life  she looks at her dad lashing out and  says we're freaks  mutants you chose this over us and you  ruined us daddy and then she says the  iconic  and famous line no more mutants  everything goes white and the world  seemingly goes back to normal however  millions of mutants have lost their  powers now a lot of people think that we  could actually see  a reverse situation of this in the one  division series instead of wanda getting  rid of mutants she could create them  and this could perhaps be how the  mutants enter the mcu  but that's a story for another day  ultimately the mutants would get their  powers back  and wanda's twin boys would end up being  reincarnated and eventually her  and her two twin boys wiccan and speed  would be reunited and would be a family  and these are the stories that the wanda  vision series is going to be based off  of  and that means we can expect to see a  lot of crazy  things wanda discovering the true witch  side of her nature using witchcraft her  finding vision  him coming back to life and the two of  them having a family wanda warping  reality which we already know is going  to happen thanks to the teaser that they  showed us  and then the possibility of her losing  her kids and possibly having a mental  breakdown  so as you can see there is a lot to look  forward to with this series it's going  to be very very exciting based off of  these four comic book runs so let me  know what you think about these stories  and let me know how you would like to  see  the one division series play out on the  disney plus show let me know what you  think in the comments down below  don't forget to like this video and  subscribe to stay up to date on  everything relating to the mcu don't  forget to follow me on instagram and  twitter for more funko pop  giveaways and as always thank you all so  much for watching woof  you

